        t←⎕AI[2] ⋄ s←50 Think b ⋄ sm←((⎕AI[2]-t)≤100)∧(⊃s)∊⍸Moves b
        e←⊃(11 Positions 1)[50] ⋄ x←I 64 0 0 Think e ⋄ ex←(0=4⊃x)∧(2⊃x)=+/~∨⌿e
